text.section:
This section shall not apply to:

The blocking of caller identification information;


Any law-enforcement agencies or any law-enforcement officer while he is engaged in the performance of his official duties;


Any intelligence or security agency of the federal government or any employee of such agency while he is engaged in the performance of his official duties; or


Any telecommunications, broadband, or Voice-over-Internet protocol service provider that is (i) acting in its capacity as an intermediary for the transmission of telephone service between the caller and the recipient, (ii) providing or configuring a service or service feature as requested by a customer, (iii) acting in a manner that is authorized or required by law, or (iv) engaging in other conduct that is a necessary incident to the provision of service.
